#. Key:	import-image-sequence-file-pattern-tooltip
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/Odyssey/Source/EposEditor/EposSequenceEditor/Private/Import/ImportImageSequenceSettingsCustomization.cpp(28)
#: Plugins/Odyssey/Source/EposEditor/EposSequenceEditor/Private/Import/ImportImageSequenceSettingsCustomization.cpp(28)
msgctxt "ImportImageSequenceSettingsCustomization,import-image-sequence-file-pattern-tooltip"
msgid "Each keywords will be replaced by its corresponding value.\n\nFor files like:\n- wonder-1-000.png\n- wonder-1-001.png\n- wonder-1-002.png\n- wonder-2-000.png\n- wonder-2-001.png\n- wonder-3-000.png\n- wonder-3-001.png\n- wonder-3-002.png\n- wonder-3-003.png\nIf the first number corresponds to the shot, and the second to each panel,\nthe pattern will look like:\n- wonder-{1}-{2}.png\n\nFor files like:\n- ful-bA-s01-00.png\n- ful-bA-s01-01.png\n- ful-bA-s01-02.png\n- ful-bA-s02-00.png\n- ful-bA-s02-01.png\n- ful-bB-s03-00.png\n- ful-bB-s03-01.png\n- ful-bB-s03-02.png\n- ful-bB-s03-03.png\nIf the first character (A or B) corresponds to the board, the next number to the shot, and the last to each panel,\nthe pattern will look like:\n- ful-b{0}-s{1}-{2}.png\n\n(Click on a keyword to Copy it)"
msgstr "Chaque mot-clé sera remplacé par sa valeur correspondante.\n\nPour des fichiers comme :\n- merveille-1-000.png\n- merveille-1-001.png\n- merveille-1-002.png\n- merveille-2-000.png\n- merveille-2-001.png\n- merveille-3-000.png\n- merveille-3-001.png\n- merveille-3-002.png\n- merveille-3-003.png\nSi le premier numéro correspond au Plan, et le second à chaque panneau,\nle motif ressemblera à :\n- merveille-{1}-{2}.png\n\nPour des fichiers comme :\n-ful-bA-s01-00.png\n-ful-bA-s01-01.png\n-ful-bA-s01-02.png\n-ful-bA-s02-00.png\n-ful-bA-s02-01.png\n-ful-bB-s03-00.png\n-ful-bB-s03-01.png\n-ful-bB-s03-02.png\n-ful-bB-s03-03.png\nSi le premier caractère (A ou B) correspond au plateau, le numéro suivant au Plan, et le dernier à chaque panneau,\nle motif ressemblera à :\n- ful-b{0}-s{1}-{2}.png\n\n(Cliquez sur un mot-clé pour le copier)"

